<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 300 million mark bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 300 million mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMOR Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LB RHEINLAND-PFALZ FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  LB RHEINLAND-PFALZ</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.125     MATURITY    27.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.681   PAY DATE    15.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.931    SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/GB/NL/CI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BUND DUE DEC.2002</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
